<view class="wrap" wx:if="{{campaign}}"><text class="title">{{campaign.title}}</text><view class="card"><text class="heading">{{campaign.subtitle}}</text><text class="rules">{{campaign.content}}</text><text class="muted">活动展示阶段：优惠券与仿真币尚未实际发放，不参与当前支付抵扣；奖励结算待上线。</text><button wx:if="{{campaign.action==='SHARE'}}" open-type="share">邀请好友</button><button wx:else bindtap="go">{{campaign.action==='ORDERS'?'查看我的订单':'去发布需求'}} ›</button></view></view><view wx:else class="wrap">活动已下线或正在加载</view>
